.TH ORGANIZE-DL 1 "2026-10-24" "organize 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
organize-dl \- deprecated name for organize
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B organize-dl
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIDIRECTORY\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B organize-dl
is the name this program used before version 0.2.0. It is kept so that
existing scripts and habits keep working.
.PP
The command now prints a deprecation warning on standard error, then runs
.BR organize (1)
with the same arguments. The old
.B \-\-dry\-run
and
.B \-n
options are translated to
.BR \-\-preview .
.PP
Everything else, including the output format and the exit status, is
described in
.BR organize (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
The exit status of
.BR organize (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR organize (1)
.SH LICENSE
MIT. See
.I /usr/share/doc/organize/copyright
on a packaged install.
